# qa-agent core

## Design split

- **Agentic:** planning, missing steps, unfamiliar UI, verdicts (ADK + LiteLLM).
- **Fixed code:** Redmine fetch, logins, value reads, math, approvals, action log, reports.
- Project specifics only in `packs/<slug>/`. Engine stays multi-project.

## Secrets & approvals

- Secrets: masked prompt → `.env` only. Never in packs, memory text, reports, chats. Wiki = addresses only.
- Model never sees passwords (`login_form` / `get_secret` type from env).
- Data/money/settings/post/email → approval. Staging may pre-approve `change_settings` at the plan gate; `redmine_post`, `send_email`, `prod_write` always one-by-one. Prod never pre-approves.
- Bugs/cases post and non-default email only after per-item confirm.

## Browser

- Stay on this run's URL hosts; other sites need OK. No CAPTCHA solving (manual login or BLOCKED). No logout of run sessions.
- Record status changes ≠ settings (don't auto-revert). Ledger test data; restore real settings.

## Scope

- No laptop installs / no new features unless asked. Prefer HANDOVER §8 gap fixes. Docs OK.
- Stack details: rule `stack`, skill `qa-stack`, `docs/stack/`, `docs/HANDOVER.md`.
